You begin to gather energy from other timelines. Your Spellpower will increase by [8.40, 16, 23, 30, 36 (TL1-5)] on the first turn and [1.40, 2.74, 3.91, 4.99, 6.00 (TL1-5)] more each additional turn.

The effect ends either when you cast a spell, or after five turns.

Eacn turn the effect is active, your Paradox will be reduced by [3, 6, 9, 12, 15 (TL1-5)].

This spell will not break Spacetime Tuning, nor will it be broken by activating Spacetime Tuning.
